        "created_at": "2014-03-31T20:31:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm not saying you can't make mistakes - just that, once a mistake is posted, we all roll with it for good or ill. FWIW, I'd say the same applies to a player mistake. I've certainly made those in games I've moderated at BGG, benefitting players sometimes and villains others. We roll with it unless it's caught &amp; corrected within 24 hours or so.</p><p>Maybe handle the IREP as \"reveal the top 3. One on the bottom, two on the top\"?&nbsp; At least that way we still might know what the options are that we're facing.</p>",
